AIOStreams web app
==================

The web client served at /web/ is the web app of AIOStreams
(packages/web of https://github.com/Viren070/AIOStreams), by Viren070 and
contributors, licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0
(the LICENSE file beside this one).

It is built from the commit named by AIOSTREAMS_COMMIT in the Dockerfile,
with the changes of patch.sh (beside this file): its files are served
under /web/, its API is the server's root, its logo and "Configure" link
point at Polyfin, and its subtitles default to a Plex-like style.

Its complete source is that commit of the AIOStreams repository with
patch.sh applied.
